            {
              "text": "The Gold Coast’s prestige residential property market is one of the most dynamic and high-performing in Australia, renowned for beachfront trophy homes, deep-water riverfront mansions, and ultra-luxury penthouses. \n\nThe leading luxury agencies and top-tier auctioneers handling this market include the following:\n\n---\n\n### **Leading Luxury Real Estate Agencies**\n\n#### **1. Kollosche**\n* **Managing Director / Figurehead:** Michael Kollosche\n* **Profile:** Widely recognized as the dominant powerhouse in Gold Coast luxury real estate. Kollosche handles a substantial share of eight-figure transactions, particularly along **Hedges Avenue and Albatross Avenue** (Mermaid Beach), Isle of Capri, and Main Beach. Known for high-impact cinematic marketing, strong buyer databases, and record-setting off-market and under-the-hammer sales.\n* **Notable Agents:** Michael Kollosche, Sam Guo, Julia Kuo, Mitch Palmer.\n\n#### **2. Amir Prestige Group**\n* **Principal:** Amir Mian\n* **Profile:** A major force across the northern waterways, hinterland acreage, and beachfront luxury. Amir Prestige is especially dominant in **Sovereign Islands, Paradise Waters, Runaway Bay, and Tallebudgera Valley**. They frequently represent architectural mega-mansions (such as the landmark $42 million *Bellagio La Villa* estate) and cater heavily to interstate and international ultra-high-net-worth buyers.\n* **Notable Agents:** Amir Mian, Alex & Victoria Fleri.\n\n#### **3. Ray White Surfers Paradise Group (Prestige Division)**\n* **Leadership:** Andrew Bell & Greg Bell\n* **Profile:** One of the largest and most established franchises in the Ray White network globally. Their prestige arm handles landmark beachfront estates, whole-floor sky homes, and canal estates. They are also famous for creating **\"The Event,\"** the Southern Hemisphere's largest collective in-room property auction held annually every summer.\n\n#### **4. Harcourts Coastal / Coastal Luxe**\n* **Leadership:** Dane Atherton\n* **Profile:** A heavyweight agency that blends high-volume residential reach with an elite luxury division (*Coastal Luxe*). They are particularly strong along the beachfront strips of **Main Beach, Surfers Paradise, and Burleigh Heads**.\n* **Notable Agents:** Tolemy Stevens (renowned specialist in beachfront luxury apartments/penthouses) and Dane Atherton.\n\n#### **5. JW. Prestige Agents**\n* **Principal:** Jordan Williams\n* **Profile:** A specialized boutique agency dealing almost exclusively in the upper tier of the Gold Coast market ($5M to $25M+ bracket). With low volume and high personalization, they maintain strong private networks across Sovereign Islands, Mermaid Waters, and Isle of Capri.\n\n#### **Other Notable Contenders:**\n* **Queensland Sotheby’s International Realty:** Connects prestige Gold Coast listings with an international luxury referral network.\n* **Whitefox Real Estate (Gold Coast):** A Melbourne-born disruptor known for aggressive digital marketing and private negotiation strategies that has gained significant traction in the Gold Coast luxury space.\n\n---\n\n### **Top-Performing Auctioneers in the Prestige Sector**\n\nSelling eight-figure homes under the hammer in Queensland requires specialized pacing, legal acumen, and high-stakes negotiation skills. Leading auctioneers calling prestige auctions on the Gold Coast include:\n\n* **Justin Nickerson (Apollo Auctions):**\n  * One of the most decorated auctioneers in Australasian history (three-time Australasian Auctioneer of the Year and multi-time REIQ Auctioneer of the Year). Nickerson is widely hired by leading independent and franchise agencies across South East Queensland to conduct major prestige auctions.\n* **Rob Doorey (Apollo Auctions):**\n  * A seasoned prestige specialist who famously called the **$24 million under-the-hammer sale of 59 The Corso (Isle of Capri)**—one of the highest prices ever achieved at an on-site residential auction in Queensland history.\n* **David Holmes (holmes. & co):**\n  * Named REIQ Auctioneer of the Year (2021 & 2023), Holmes is a prominent independent auctioneer regularly contracted by top-tier luxury agents (including Amir Prestige) to orchestrate high-profile acreage and waterfront sales.\n* **Andrew Bell (Ray White Surfers Paradise):**\n  * An industry legend with over four decades of auctioneering experience. Bell personally calls major multi-million-dollar parcels during *The Event* and conducts high-stakes in-room and on-site auctions for the group’s key prestige clients.\n* **Mark MacCabe:**\n  * Former Chief Auctioneer for Amir Prestige and a past REIQ Auctioneer of the Year. Highly experienced in working crowds of high-net-worth bidders and managing extended pauses for reserve negotiations on Sovereign Islands and riverfront mega-mansions.\n* **Paul Cavanagh:**\n  * A veteran who has called over 20,000 auctions and holds the rare distinction of being named Auctioneer of the Year in both Queensland and NSW. He is trusted for complex, high-pressure luxury campaigns requiring calm and strategic execution.",
